si[i++] = gsitm("N802020170000700ENG.html", "When removing the intercooler radiator reservoir tank cap, use care to avoid contact with hot intercooler coolant or steam. Place a shop towel over the intercooler radiator reservoir tank cap and turn the intercooler radiator reservoir tank cap counterclockwise a little to let the pressure escape through the vinyl tube. After relieving the steam pressure, remove the intercooler radiator reservoir tank cap by slowly turning it counterclockwise.", "ptxt");
